template+symbol: THROW TypeError: Cannot convert a Symbol value to a string
String-obj: ["0", "1"] | true | "b" | ["0", "1", "length"]
valueOf: "v" | "p" | "q"
valueOf-bad: THROW TypeError: not a String object
toString-bad: THROW TypeError: not a String object
search-str: 2 | 0 | 1 | 1
matchAll-nonglobal: THROW TypeError: String.prototype.matchAll called with a non-global RegExp
normalize-basic: true
coercions: 1 | "--aaa" | "4"
